{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING: THIS GAME CONTAINS STROBING LIGHTS AND HARSH FLASHES.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DISTURBING CONTENT: THIS GAME FEATURES DISTURBING CONTENT AND IS NOT SUITABLE FOR CHILDREN.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The old, unfinished Lily's Lil Games webseries is back, and recompiled for modern systems! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Happy Video Store, where every day is a brand-new adventure! Step into the shoes of Lily, a bright and cheerful employee determined to become the <i>very best worker</i> her little hometown rental shop has ever seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your job sounds simple enough:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcfc Sort through endless VHS tapes and keep the rows looking perfect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 Stock shelves and clean up after customers, no matter how messy they get.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6d Spend time with Mimi, Lily\u2019s best friend who sometimes stops by during shifts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shift gives you new challenges, new visitors, and new chances to help Lily prove she\u2019s the best employee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clock in. Do your best. Keep the shelves tidy.<br>At the Happy Video Store, the fun never ends.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First day!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3958020/53ec7a14f4fe19de6ab1e59815def881888a5d96.jpg"},{"name":"Saved Mimi!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3958020/ba4e5787c2544d9770d7c5f85ebc55c9fec1bfac.jpg"},{"name":"Mimi saved herself!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3958020/f4db73edd1b9473b448edef2708c2005d441bf9f.jpg"},{"name":"The Perfect Job","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pub